    "https://jobs.oberlin.edu/postings/17539": {
      "title": "Jobs",
      "description": "Oberlin College & Conservatory Applicant Portal | Cleveland Student Shuttle Driver Skip to Main Content Jobs at Oberlin Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help Human Resources Contact Us Benefits Student Employment Cleveland Student Shuttle Driver Below you will find the details for the position including any supplementary documentation and questions you should review before applying for the opening.  To apply for the position, please click the Apply for this Job link/button. If you would like to bookmark this position for later review, click on the Bookmark link. If you would like to print a copy of this position for your records, click on the Print Preview link. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Please see Special Instructions for more details. A completed application will consist of a cover letter, resume and list of references. Posting Details Announcement Information Job Summary Oberlin College and Conservatory is proud to introduce a Cleveland shuttle for students! The shuttle would take students, on Thursday-Sunday, to various locations throughout the Greater Cleveland Area. Locations include Crocker Park, University Circle, and more! Multiple drivers will be selected and will sign for shifts as their schedule allows. The shuttle is a 22-passenger transit vehicle. Responsibilities Drive students on set shuttle routes on various dates throughout the school year. Multiple drivers will be selected to fulfill the entire schedule. The tentative schedule is as follows: Thursday Evening: One Round-Trip Visit to Avon Commons and Crocker Park [5:00pm-9:00pm] [Approximately 45 Miles] Friday Evening: One Round-Trip Visit to Ohio City, Downtown Arcade District, and Tremont [5:00pm-10:00pm] [Approximately 75 Miles] Saturday Afternoon: Two Round-Trip Visits to University Circle, Little Italy, and China Town [10:00am-2:00pm; 3:00pm-7:00pm] [Approximately 150 Miles] Sunday Afternoon: Two Round-Trip Visits to Avon Commons and Crocker Park [11:00am-2:00pm; 3:00pm-6:00pm] [Approximately 90 Miles] Take student attendance getting on- and off- the shuttle to ensure students are accounted for safely. Communicate updates on issues and successes to the Office of Student Leadership and Involvement. Troubleshoot issues, in collaboration with Campus Safety and Student Leadership and Involvement, as they arise. Serve as a positive representative of Oberlin College and Conservatory. Provide maintenance updates on the vehicle to Student Leadership and Involvement and Facility Operations. Provide recommendations on route changes and improvements. Other duties as assigned. Qualifications Must possess a valid passenger Commerical Drivers License ( CDL ) within the state of Ohio. Driver must maintain eligibility of insurability as demonstrated by Oberlin College and pass a MVR check. Ability to communicate well with others. Punctual and reliable as an employee. Ability to assist physically challenged passengers in wheelchairs on or off the vehicle. Quick Link for Posting https://jobs.oberlin.edu/postings/17522 Compensation $25 per hour Special Instructions to Applicants A completed application will consist of a cover letter, resume and list of references. Documents Needed to Apply Required Documents Resume List of References Optional Documents Cover Letter Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). Do you maintain a current Commerical Driver's License (CDL) in the state of Ohio for a passenger commercial vehicle? (Open Ended Question) Why would you make a good candidate for this position? (Open Ended Question) How many years of experience do you have related to the position for which you are applying? 0 - 1 years 1 - 3 years 3 - 5 years 5 - 7 years 7 plus years About how many hours/week would you prefer to work? (Open Ended Question) Office of Human Resources Oberlin College 173 West Lorain Street Oberlin OH 44074 http://new.oberlin.edu/office/human-resources/ Phone: (440) 775-8430 Fax: (440) 775-8683 Hours: M-F 8:00 a.m. - 5:00 p.m. human.resources@oberlin.edu 2015 © Oberlin College | Privacy Policy To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
